    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「お昼どきなのかな、いいにおいが空気に漂ってるよね！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「甘いにおい！　このにおい、絵で表現したい！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ど～しよ、どうすればいい？　試行錯誤するのが楽しいよ～！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「画用紙が足りないよ～、でぇへへ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「転校生、何でここにいるのか知らないけど。ちょうどよかった～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「暇だったら、そのへんの売店で画用紙とか買ってきてくんない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「紙なら何でもいいよ！　土産物のノートぐらいなら売ってるでしょ～、よろしく！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「できれば色鉛筆とか、そういうのもお願いね！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「いやぁ、転校生がいてよかった！　ほんと便利だよね！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「愛してるよ、ちゅっちゅ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「でぇへへ♪　テンションあがってるの、あたし！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「おんもで絵ぇ描くの、最高に楽しいんだもん☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「やっぱり人間、お日さま浴びないとだめだよね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「閉じこもってると脳みそ腐っちゃう！　指先もね！　あたしは自由に創作するよ～！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あぁ、もう帰りたくないなぁ……♪　でも帰んないと、ば～ちゃんが心配するしなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「いま、何時ぐらい？　ちょっとお腹すいてきたかも、喉もかわいた！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ずっと絵ぇ描いてたから……転校生、食べ物とかも買ってきて！　早く！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あたし、画用紙の前から動きたくないの！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「……うにゅ!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "（あ、ありゃ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "（絵ぇ描くのに夢中になってて、気づくの遅れたけど。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "（何か、背中に違和感があるような……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "（背中に、何かが乗ってる？　体温も、感じるような？　つまり、生き物が乗ってる？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "（えっと。近くからは、転校生の声しかしないし……じゃあ、つまり？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "（もしかして。て、転校生のやつが、あたしに乗ってる～っ!?）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "（ど～して？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "（ていうか乗ってるどころか、抱きしめられてるっていうか？　密着してる～っ!?）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "（え？　え？　何で？　ど～して？　意味がわからない！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "（どうしてこんな状況？　わからないっ、画用紙しか見てなかったもん～っ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「えっと、転校生！　あのね、どういうつもりか知らないけどねっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「よくないよ！　こういうのは……えっと、なっつんにしてあげなよ～っ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あたしなんか触っても、つまんないでしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「どうかしてるよ！　転校生、きっと春の陽気に頭がやられてるの！」"
